# EAS uploads the whole repository, not just the app folder, but the only thing
# it ever builds is mobile/. Everything else is left out so a build does not
# carry the 71 MB audio index and the 12 MB model checkpoint that the app never
# reads. Without this an upload is about 182 MB instead of under one.
#
# This file replaces .gitignore for EAS uploads, so anything that must stay out
# of a build has to be listed here too.
#
# The negation below has no trailing slash on purpose. Written as "!mobile/",
# the bare path "mobile" stays ignored, EAS prunes the directory before it ever
# looks inside, and the upload comes out empty.

/*
!/mobile

# Installed and generated folders inside the app.
mobile/node_modules/
mobile/.expo/
mobile/dist/
mobile/web-build/
mobile/ios/
mobile/android/

# Signing material and secrets, in case any ever lands in the app folder.
*.jks
*.p8
*.p12
*.key
*.mobileprovision
*.pem
.env
.env.local
*.env.local
